# RiyadNova AI Asset Management

## Overview

This document defines how visual assets are organized, managed, and used across the RiyadNova AI platform.

Assets include logos, icons, images, illustrations, animations, and other design resources.

---

# Asset Structure

The assets folder contains:

assets/

├── logo/

├── icons/

├── images/

├── illustrations/

├── animations/

└── brand/

---

# 1. Logo Assets

Location:

assets/logo/

Contains:

- Primary logo
- Dark background logo
- Light background logo
- Icon-only logo
- Social media logo

File Formats:

- SVG (preferred)
- PNG
- WebP

---

# 2. Icons

Location:

assets/icons/

Contains icons for:

- AI tools
- Dashboard
- Navigation
- Features
- Notifications
- User interface

Requirements:

- Consistent style
- Modern appearance
- Scalable format

---

# 3. Images

Location:

assets/images/

Contains:

- Website images
- Product screenshots
- Marketing visuals
- Background images

Requirements:

- High quality
- Optimized size
- Web-friendly formats

---

# 4. Illustrations

Location:

assets/illustrations/

Contains:

- AI concepts
- Business illustrations
- Startup visuals
- User journey graphics

Style:

- Futuristic
- Professional
- Minimal

---

# 5. Animations

Location:

assets/animations/

Contains:

- Loading animations
- AI interaction effects
- Interface transitions

Formats:

- Lottie
- SVG animations

---

# 6. Brand Resources

Location:

assets/brand/

Contains:

- Brand guidelines
- Color references
- Typography files
- Marketing materials

---

# File Naming Rules

Use clear names:

Examples:

ai-cofounder-icon.svg

dashboard-preview.webp

logo-primary.svg


Avoid:

image1.png

newlogo2.png

final-final.png

---

# Optimization Rules

All assets should:

- Load quickly
- Maintain quality
- Work on mobile devices
- Follow brand guidelines

